### 카카오 로그인
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/social
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "KAKAO",
  "accessToken": "replace-with-kakao-access-token"
}

### 공유 게시물을 내 아카이브에 저장
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shared-posts/{{shareToken}}/1/save
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupIds": [1]
}
